<title>INDIA: India RBI raises 62.50 bln rupees at repo auction.</title>
<headline>India RBI raises 62.50 bln rupees at repo auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Monday it had received and accepted bids for 62.50 billion rupees at a four-day repo auction.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
